# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Model checksums (SHA-256) for download integrity verification.
#
# Generate/update this file by running:
#   ./scripts/download_models.sh --generate-checksums
#
# After downloading models, the script will compute SHA-256 hashes
# and write them here. Commit this file to lock model versions.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Format: <sha256>  <filename>
# Entries below are generated automatically — do not edit by hand.
